---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="Magnetic Proxy 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/magneticproxy.png`} alt="Magnetic Proxy" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">Magnetic Proxy 深度评测</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">高性能住宅代理，99.95% 成功率</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">评分概览</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">综合评分</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">8.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">成功率</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">响应速度</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">覆盖范围</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">8.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">性价比</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">产品概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Magnetic Proxy 是一家专注于住宅代理的服务商，以 99.95% 的高成功率和 0.6s 平均响应速度著称。提供从 $5/GB 起的灵活计费方案。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          支持 HTTP/HTTPS 和 SOCKS5 协议，城市、地区和城市级 geo-targeting 免费。使用 Capsule 系统可创建独立隔离的代理池。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          适合数据采集、广告验证、SEO 监测等场景，是所有主流指纹浏览器中性能最优的代理之一。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">核心特性详解</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">99.95% 成功率</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">经过生产环境验证的高成功率，平均 0.6s 响应时间。在同类代理中表现卓越。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">免费 Geo-targeting</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持按国家、地区和城市级精确定位，所有方案均免费包含。hardcountry-true 参数防止回退到错误位置。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Capsule 独立代理池</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Capsule 系统允许创建独立配置和流量统计的代理池。适合多项目隔离管理。每个 Capsule 独立计费和配置。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">旋转/粘性双模式</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">默认自动轮换 IP，每请求新 IP。通过 sessid 参数可切换到粘性模式，保持同一 IP。同一端点上即可切换。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">多协议支持</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">HTTP（端口 80/1080）、HTTPS（443）、SOCKS5（9000）、SOCKS5h（9000），覆盖主流使用场景。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">适用场景详细分析</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. 大规模数据采集</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">高成功率和快速响应保证数据采集效率。Capsule 系统隔离不同项目的数据流量。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. 广告验证</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">城市级定位可精确查看不同地区的广告投放效果。住宅 IP 难以被检测为代理。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. SEO 监测</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">通过全球各地住宅 IP 查看搜索排名，获取准确的 SEO 数据。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>99.95% 高成功率</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>0.6s 快速响应</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>免费城市级定位</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Capsule 代理池独立管理</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>$5/GB 起低门槛</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L3.34 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>仅住宅代理无移动代理</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>品牌知名度较低</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无中文界面</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Magnetic Proxy 以 99.95% 的成功率和 0.6s 响应速度在住宅代理市场中建立了良好的技术口碑。免费的城市级定位和 Capsule 独立代理池系统是其差异化优势。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          综合评估，Magnetic Proxy 获得 7.0 分，适合对代理稳定性和响应速度有高要求的用户。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://www.magneticproxy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 Magnetic Proxy 官网
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
